WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:35.085
"I must go to the shop today," Dora said.

2
00:00:35.086 --> 00:00:39.149
"Ugh." Her five ducklings groaned.

3
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:43.758
"The shop is boring," the biggest duckling said.

4
00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:52.024
"Can we stay here?"

5
00:00:52.025 --> 00:00:56.070
"I will watch your ducklings," Jemima said.

6
00:00:56.071 --> 00:00:59.164
"I can take care of six babies."

7
00:00:59.165 --> 00:01:02.238
"Hmm . . . ," Dora said.

8
00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:04.818
"Are you sure?"

9
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:15.375
"Yes!" Jemima snapped. "I am sure."

10
00:01:15.376 --> 00:01:30.446
"Thank you," Dora said. "I will be back soon."

11
00:01:30.447 --> 00:01:52.948
Jemima led all the ducklings around the farm.

12
00:01:52.949 --> 00:01:56.407
Her baby followed her.

13
00:01:56.408 --> 00:01:58.706
But the other ducklings stopped.

14
00:01:58.707 --> 00:02:00.158
"Me first!"

15
00:02:00.159 --> 00:02:02.563
"You were first last time!"

16
00:02:02.564 --> 00:02:18.500
"My turn!"

17
00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:21.958
"No fighting!" Jemima said.

18
00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:25.484
"Come along."

19
00:02:25.485 --> 00:02:47.606
Dora's ducklings ran after Jemima.

20
00:02:47.607 --> 00:02:50.813
"This is easy," Jemima said.

21
00:02:50.814 --> 00:02:55.869
Suddenly it seemed very quiet.

22
00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:59.092
"Uh-oh," Jemima said.

23
00:02:59.093 --> 00:03:01.682
She looked back.

24
00:03:01.683 --> 00:03:06.862
Dora's ducklings were gone!
